{"job_id":"F-1af7e319eef954dd5fab","family_id":"F-1af7e319eef954dd5fab","title":"베트남 법원연수원 역량강화사업 기술용역계약에 따른 용역비 취급규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":36,"target_id":"9945108bb8efcc0759d581289d69910f23e3d5e3f6c342c809ca25c4a861655c","source_hash":"e901ba37b2f58ccea6d30a07518f212826ba763b671dbadae1146d6de1514466","text":"越南法院培训学院能力建设项目技术服务合同项下服务费处理规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":8,"target_id":"91e4f5279e704e12f4ac278102ad938952f5e2ec792a31a37acec3e2504f14b6","source_hash":"936838281cb39bbbae8a4860b7451d4f9faebcce63277d98ffdb8c23a6992fc8","text":"第一章 总则\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"BODY","start":8,"end":186,"target_id":"b9eccca3f813081ba6a971313e13e7b41d43b9dd0ce306d0db8ee55913b07480","source_hash":"ccb7b054fbef9bcba2de4ce5e061c31780eff7dd74c87be751e60ead9439537f","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是根据《韩国国际合作机构法》第7条和《赠款合作项目采购和合同条例》（以下简称“条例”）第32条的规定，为越南法院培训学院能力建设项目技术服务合同（以下简称“条例”）的透明、严格执行服务费制定适当的会计程序。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"BODY","start":186,"end":466,"target_id":"205d6987da666f44ad265aae10b4566bc1b560cce18ddf6ec052c403c97a55c9","source_hash":"edb477270df53d60dcd32db11d04c6239152916b9d96eefa99d97869168ecd67","text":"第二条（定义）本规则中使用的术语定义如下。\n1.“服务费”是指韩国国际合作机构根据上述条例第32条规定的技术服务项目执行计划中的项目成本执行计划，应法院要求向法院支付的，不属于收入和支出范围的现金。\n2. “出纳员”一词是指根据《国家财政管理法》实施细则负责非收入和支出现金的现金支付人员（包括代理该现金支付人员全部职责或被指派履行其部分职责的人员）。\n3。“处理点”一词是指《银行法》第2条第1款第2项所定义的金融机构的总行或分支机构。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"BODY","start":466,"end":533,"target_id":"f58cecdc19c2cfa12f317714d921488e9370de18c055ad3b710a529cec904975","source_hash":"039d6a64ea4ca806b397c5c53e8f51d66785017e146ea4b5d7e0f6a6c9278bb8","text":"第三条（适用范围）除其他法律另有规定外，服务费利息的收取、保管和支付，均适用本规则。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"BODY","start":533,"end":590,"target_id":"8d8943e830ff72cafd4dabc255393ca0bc308dc3559a69d515cbe82ac2540b39","source_hash":"8ec684a1214f5ddafc03a9f79355711b559197c25bd1803a83aa19ff1dedc6bf","text":"第四条（服务费办理点）法院行政办公室的法院存款办理点（以下简称“办理点”）负责办理服务费。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"BODY","start":590,"end":679,"target_id":"b431115fa9c992db0b1aec187f58e862baf6bf1f86bea67973d2acb8fd9a2cb8","source_hash":"2914e241e9a9b86c9da5283efb53eb0d93c40c4348d01e61a4906663bbd27a9d","text":"第五条（出纳员职务及姓名等的通知）出纳员应当向有关处理部门报告其职务及姓名，并附上其印章。\n\n第二章 服务费等的支付与管理\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"BODY","start":679,"end":746,"target_id":"367aaf21d3e4981455e641a22bd0b8ab43090bd8abc1d627240fc9b5a1e0cd12","source_hash":"2f57462523bbd47acb20bc881819d4a31c376895a1942d709fecabf53e0e34c8","text":"第六条（服务费管理账户的开设）法院行政办公室应当为管理服务费开设单独的账户（一般账户和存款账户）。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"BODY","start":746,"end":787,"target_id":"427880d534826c5cfe4428dc387070f5a5fa257e2db3c2c60c722a296cc2fee7","source_hash":"6569dcecac52370c89c1392e224b6c17fde1a3358bd82f69ca10e5e6ae4fa3d3","text":"第七条（会计管理）法院行政办公室应当通过单独的会计系统管理服务费。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"BODY","start":787,"end":851,"target_id":"581a40771276716f8022b6fe505d241e84ed591ad0a3cbdd0fb5a038f883f5c9","source_hash":"95a0284038eea100a3fbf098540702fb4f0002be193894a08c21df9f4ea99343","text":"第 8 条（服务费的支付）韩国国际合作机构应将服务费支付到根据第 6 条开设的法院行政办公室账户（一般账户）。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"BODY","start":851,"end":916,"target_id":"89a3b4ac746f4592b912a9d5d93f8b5b1eaddfe7c434bd430aba5da6735a66a8","source_hash":"addeea9ef5c9a3604c281ba0a7c954405de717d722aa5f5b0e0667bd7067008d","text":"第九条（经销商对服务费的管理）经销商应当按照法院存款规定管理服务费。\n\n第三章 服务费的执行和支付程序\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"BODY","start":916,"end":964,"target_id":"7b5a0722f65c4e576d0b6cd02fd4ff12febb7e8cd378f210ef9f7934bf88f898","source_hash":"ebba06d1462582ea63011433d2d457c6f53525b3e3d11aedc595286c25f7e9ef","text":"第十条（服务费管理）法院行政办公室行政管理办公室主任负责服务费的管理。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"BODY","start":964,"end":1000,"target_id":"cf0ac8f839810bc7f2a0e588c817e6eceed030768eef051c84aadc2fae90f795","source_hash":"ca26b1fd59a813b3314a8ce226aef35ca251f800d77fd540bc673c796fb374f1","text":"第 11 条（服务费的执行）服务费应由经理按照第 10 条执行。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1000,"end":1139,"target_id":"a48cee03c3b9c6e23f802a6a32b893675f04784d81eaedcb31482e96133dc206","source_hash":"8c1102e6f95651454272916748631234ce4410e7ef6017c7fce021781d0886db","text":"第十二条（付款请求等）\n① 提款申请人应按照附件表格1申报存款账户。\n② 服务费管理员执行导致支出的行为后，出纳员向存款处理分行发送付款指令。\n③ 处理分支机构根据提款指示将款项存入索赔人账户。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1139,"end":1206,"target_id":"698f41b03f74bcd4b29a84feec9488d0aa4da4328e92c2acb164438d9f541ec0","source_hash":"e3e4f38f1564f4be3241139c26a6b4fe5eec3dfe630fa6d2b3c4f15f1f2860af","text":"第十三条（处理站处理）处理站向索赔人支付服务费时，应当立即将详情传送给收银员。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1206,"end":1339,"target_id":"c8f0cb2a12c096dabe86fa2991ab0a63068cc4afb4bb983354875222a49c146f","source_hash":"e36e970d9b723407c19037f77e09d36eab8aa4795a32eb039abb08761d5a00ee","text":"第十四条（现金账簿等）\n① 出纳员应每月打印出本表所附表格 2 中的现金账簿，并与本表所附表格 3 中的服务费收支明细表进行核对。\n② 出纳员应按附件表格 4 的形式打印每月服务费报表，并每月取得行政批准。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1339,"end":1535,"target_id":"963d006d2a590a941adfbf999fc1bffa64d9e0646d8e0446403768db25e9af4c","source_hash":"4b32bd3d63e002de9de53aa3c3323a3d1bd026d4120cfe8a25248736bc160561","text":"第十五条（预扣税的缴纳）\n① 如果待支付的服务费需预扣税款，支付人员应让处理分行扣除预扣税款后将余额汇回处理分行。\n② 出纳员应于次月10日前将每月最后一天的预扣税款缴付给主管税务机关。\n③ 出纳员应按附件表格 5 的形式，用电脑打印并保存预扣税报表。\n\n第四章 补充规定\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1535,"end":1728,"target_id":"cc8b34507bd277079606c19dcf0d1c6e7b305b46a00f5a78f4950e1620d03e8f","source_hash":"d6706519fc322bcef270ceb3f81b91758a3e70bbf9b53290594bb284608b87de","text":"第十六条（未用余额等） 服务费结算完毕后，任何未使用的余额、服务费存款利息或其他收入，应当退还至依第六条规定开立的法院行政办公室账户（一般账户）。但是，因不可抗力因素导致本年度内发生但未能当年度内支付的费用，可以结转至下年度使用。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1728,"end":1796,"target_id":"4c5f4f1109713a2247440d3a9f99c3e9e887416ab2dc3c1a63f4355f42014443","source_hash":"14c8182f166d38c95995e371acfc7433cca811531b65328e10769492ed809cdd","text":"第十七条（账簿等的保存）有关收入、支付和支出的数据记录（包括计算机化介质）和证据文件应当保存五年。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1796,"end":1963,"target_id":"54717724e2cb6db36ebf0efbcda6d0a7446570a92aba8e3de2790fb1d6f9d205","source_hash":"2a60348a0778c795ed5f5454b0941358d3dac6f9747e1180d80cc5bac801c78b","text":"第18条（支出凭证的管理）\n① 支出证明文件应为支出授权表和附件表格 3 中的服务费收支明细表。\n支出相关证明文件应按付款日期每月编制，并由出纳员管理。\n③ 法院行政办公室要求传送上述证据文件时，出纳员应当遵照要求办理。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1963,"end":2018,"target_id":"39770c52ec399c4a7c48ac1a301623c6b81882d702b59c4d941840e0250eb973","source_hash":"6fe08ab4132091a73b5f1beefcc96e37d3786d7df98e9e72529d62513c8f93cd","text":"第十九条（比照适用）除本规则另有规定外，《法院存款处理规则》比照适用。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2018,"end":2073,"target_id":"16ac1d0bb8e8136f26b4b452bd1fb91eac1d1f7379f378e0ac5b2ada3cdf4a4e","source_hash":"053b6eb0433cc1d7de51a89d684d7b74aa4860f41c5694377f0bfe8af246bfa9","text":"补充规定 <第2464号，2013年5月1日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n服务费账户存款申请\n"},{"id":"A37655-zh-00001","doc":"A37655","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2751624","source_hash":"455340b7f3d7a7c6abebe46edd5cbf30d47132120eaac10345119330bbdb6cd9","text":"[附件表格编号 1]"},{"id":"A37655-zh-00002","doc":"A37655","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2751625","source_hash":"ddb72fc44de8ae89501045d83f86cf7b20a084d6abfaa1a0a194ebdee6f227a0","text":"服务费账户存款申请"},{"id":"A37655-zh-00003","doc":"A37655","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2751626","source_hash":"3b4f24ee287cd365558f1fa6004edf56b9ad1a82b4261475de9e4fb5bf892c86","text":"合约名称"},{"id":"A37655-zh-00004","doc":"A37655","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2751627","source_hash":"521b6c45440f31109c6f31f1ad0a8d98fb83c678f4562f7af7f315da5efa7c5a","text":"服务详情"},{"id":"A37655-zh-00005","doc":"A37655","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2751628","source_hash":"18acb003b66cff522e76d3f2279895ad7242ead14fd06a143a4ebdbbde1630a9","text":"派对"},{"id":"A37655-zh-00006","doc":"A37655","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2751630","source_hash":"83a1148ca5c02c9b6d7cfaf53fa3011308d5c3ab4812a58d9208d7e989365a47","text":"开放银行"},{"id":"A37655-zh-00007","doc":"A37655","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2751631","source_hash":"9630c6227715da131d3e2213d72c6454d96ddaf5e094257425b7198fd5614749","text":"银行"},{"id":"A37655-zh-00008","doc":"A37655","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2751632","source_hash":"66c785ce1f5d42b62f3136ac804ca47aa5640f09b2adfff78bdb1b1cea41e9c2","text":"分支"},{"id":"A37655-zh-00009","doc":"A37655","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2751635","source_hash":"5add92fab34229aed4a9dd2731d9f1c90c2e1b7236625bb818319773bb65d26e","text":"存款类型"},{"id":"A37655-zh-00010","doc":"A37655","law_id":"kr-011849-139904-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2751638","source_hash":"d6f030e0b2b54ac203dc14